$ .venv/bin/python scripts/validate_content_os_task.py --help
exit 0
usage: validate_content_os_task.py [-h] --task TASK --vault-root VAULT_ROOT
                                   --capabilities CAPABILITIES
                                   [--blocked-result-out BLOCKED_RESULT_OUT]

Validate a Content OS v0.2 task before the Mac runner executes it. The
validator deliberately reads the project overview and, for revision work, the
canonical change request. A ready queue file is therefore only an instruction:
it cannot make an old project revision or an unconfirmed idea executable on
its own.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --task TASK
  --vault-root VAULT_ROOT
  --capabilities CAPABILITIES
  --blocked-result-out BLOCKED_RESULT_OUT
